title: Another program appends to a file of the host, makes a new one, the host saves an edit and deletes a file: the guest's folder follows each
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: saved .*other\.txt
expect-file: share-text\brand-new.txt :: ^a file that was not there\n$
expect-file: share-text\other.txt :: ^saved-by-host\.alpha\n
absent-file: share-text\docs\deep\inner.txt
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text

wait 3000
share start
wait 9000
touch notes.txt appended by another program
wait 2500
touch brand-new.txt a file that was not there
wait 4500
edit other.txt 1 1
type saved-by-host.
wait 500
key save
wait 2000
key escape
delete docs/deep/inner.txt
wait 600
answer Delete
wait 5000
fit
wait 1500
mark host-after-changes
wait 7000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
fit
wait 5500
mark after-touch-and-new-file
wait 14000
fit
wait 1500
mark after-all-changes
wait 2500
quit
wait 1500
